# Sepolia deployment role accounts — copy to .env and fill with REAL keys.
# .env is gitignored; never commit real keys. Do NOT reuse the devnet
# test-junk mnemonic accounts on a public testnet (they get swept instantly).
#
# Funding requirements (Sepolia ETH):
#   DEPLOYER  — YES, ~0.3-0.5 (one-time: op-deployer apply deploys the full
#               OP-Stack L1 contract suite; also owner of proxies/SystemConfig
#               and fee-vault recipient per l2-intent.toml.template)
#   BATCHER   — YES, ongoing (submits blob batches to the L1 BatchInbox;
#               start with ~0.5 and top up as it drains)
#   SEQUENCER — no L1 ETH (unsafeBlockSigner: signs p2p unsafe blocks only)
#   PROPOSER  — no L1 ETH (registered in the intent, but no proposer service
#               runs in this permissioned no-fault-proof deployment)
#   CHALLENGER— no L1 ETH (registered only, no service)

DEPLOYER_ADDR=
DEPLOYER_KEY=
SEQUENCER_ADDR=
SEQUENCER_KEY=
BATCHER_ADDR=
BATCHER_KEY=
PROPOSER_ADDR=
PROPOSER_KEY=
CHALLENGER_ADDR=
CHALLENGER_KEY=
